ature — Human Artificer Rogue', 'Legendary Creature — Human Bard', 'Legendary Creature — Human Citizen', 'Legendary Creature — Human Detective', 'Legendary Creature — Human Doctor', 'Legendary Creature — Human Knight', 'Legendary Creature — Human Mercenary', 'Legendary Creature — Human Pilot', 'Legendary Creature — Human Ranger', 'Legendary Creature — Human Rogue', 'Legendary Creature — Human Scientist', 'Legendary Creature — Human Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Human Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Insect Mutant', 'Legendary Creature — Mutant Advisor', 'Legendary Creature — Mutant Berserker', 'Legendary Creature — Mutant Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Treefolk Mutant', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Mutant Advisor', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Mutant Rogue', 'Sorcery']
